@Seive2_HostAddress = http://192.168.1.9:5150

### Health Check
GET {{Seive2_HostAddress}}/api/job/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Start a new sieve job (find primes up to 1 million)
POST {{Seive2_HostAddress}}/api/job/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxNumber": 1000000,
  "segmentSize": 100000
}

###

### Get current job status
GET {{Seive2_HostAddress}}/api/job/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Worker requests next work segment
POST {{Seive2_HostAddress}}/api/work/next
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workerId": "test-worker-1",
  "workerName": "Test Worker"
}

###

### Submit work result (example - use actual SegmentId from work response)
POST {{Seive2_HostAddress}}/api/work/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "segmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "workerId": "test-worker-1",
  "primesFound": 12345,
  "success": true
}

###
